draw.io (embedded in Collie)

Collie bundles the draw.io web editor in embed mode (Contents/Resources/drawio/web/), from draw.io
v32.6.1 (https://github.com/jgraph/drawio, commit 84487b4891cbc0f32d7e30f34cf878c87cb1f414),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (Contents/Resources/drawio/LICENSE).
draw.io and diagrams.net are trademarks of JGraph Ltd; Collie is not affiliated with or endorsed by
JGraph, and uses the names only to identify the origin of this component (Apache-2.0 section 6).

Only the files embed mode needs are included (no Confluence/viewer bundles, servlet, service worker,
templates, math typesetting, or the Azure and Microsoft cloud icon sets).

Changes made by Collie (patches/drawio/ in the Collie source):
- 0001-collie-branding.patch: the page title is "Diagrama", the splash logo is removed, the GitHub
  link in the page bar is removed, and the offline Help menu shows only the version (the keyboard
  shortcut sheet it opened carries third-party branding).
